// # Three println string statements
//
// Logline: Print three string literals so emit-wasm can plant all three texts.
//
// Setup: One public main. Body is only three println(STRING) statements.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Print line-a.
//   2. Print line-b then line-c.
//   3. Leave no other statements.

pub fn main() {
    println("line-a");
    println("line-b");
    println("line-c");
}
